Subject: Re: [stan-users] Block Diagonals with gaussian_dlm_obs function
Message-ID: <H0iaSlJRKRM.Hcw7_Uo-lj8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <H0iaSlJRKRM.t9lcsm7ox5IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <H0iaSlJRKRM.t9lcsm7ox5IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
