How is the effective sample size for degrees of freedom?  Is the simulated
value in the posterior 95% interval?

If both of these tests look OK, then the question is how close you expect
the posterior mean to be to the posterior mode.  Stan returns the posterior
mean and median in its summaries of MCMC output, not the posterior mode.

- Bob

