One way or another, you need to integrate / marginalize over all potential true values of the observation times. Unless you know of a way to do this analytically, you will need to do it numerically, i.e. by specifying a latent variable for the true timing of each observation.

From u3f22b207863d2049 at groups.google.com  Thu Aug 14 07:14:30 2014
