Subject: Re: [stan-users] Trouble with Multivariate Regression
Message-ID: <D4F-EvufsN0.v8ZPoDal85AJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <D4F-EvufsN0.dXapgsHqKYkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <D4F-EvufsN0.1vVpK7igXPkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <D4F-EvufsN0.dXapgsHqKYkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
