>
> Is this error caused by insufficient coding or internal restriction of stan?

Both, since Stan needs to know the support of the parameters (which can be unbounded on one or both sides). At a minimum, you would need to change inside the parameters block to:

vector<lower=0>[C] tau_mix;
real<lower=0,upper=1> q[N];

I'm not sure if that is sufficient.

Ben

