The parametric nonlinear model example given in Gelman et al. (2004) and summarized in BDA3 Example 19.1 is very interesting. I would like to learn more about how the parameter estimation and inference is done using STAN. Does anyone know if there is publicly available STAN code performing the steps discussed in the example? The BDA3 site doesn't look to have anything related to the model for Example 19.1.

