Specifically, there are only a few things that it can
tell are safe on the left side: plain old parameters and
indexing of parameters and some known linear functions applied
to parameters.  If there are local variables or transformed
parameters involved, there's no way to trace the path of
execution to see what transform's done.

- Bob

