From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 26 17:45:04 2014
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Tue, 26 Aug 2014 17:45:04 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] What is a good default prior for a scale parameter?
Message-ID: <-EvOdsiNJlY.soVl1dnZV18J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
