(1) In our paper we recommend the Wishart, not the inverse-Wishart.
(2) But we recommend a Wishart for point estimation to keep the point estimate away from 0.  For full Bayes inferecne this is not a concern and we recommend the scaled inverse-Wishart or LKJ or maybe some other thing.

