From u63f31e9cf527ebbb at groups.google.com  Thu Aug 28 16:51:15 2014
From: u63f31e9cf527ebbb at groups.google.com (Bentley Coffey)
Date: Thu, 28 Aug 2014 16:51:15 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Memory and speed for an LDA model
Message-ID: <3aCWlCguL_s.H6hgYDDaeXAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <3aCWlCguL_s.Zzx6pEN8caAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <3aCWlCguL_s.nTtFKkYMKKwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <3aCWlCguL_s.Zzx6pEN8caAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
